==============================================================================================
H4  THE 1/12 SEED (Bernoulli): int_0^1 ((x))^2 dx = 1/12 = B_2/2 = -zeta(-1)
==============================================================================================
   numeric int ((x))^2 = 0.08333333   exact 1/12 = 0.08333333
   => the sawtooth variance IS 1/12; the residual's rms lives in this Bernoulli seed,
      the same 1/12 as Dedekind reciprocity and zeta(-1)=-1/12 (the killer-sum limit).

